List all the maintenances of a MongoDB® Database Instance.

USAGE:
  scw mongodb maintenance list [arg=value ...]

ARGS:
  [instance-id]     ID of the instance
  [order-by]        Criteria to use when requesting user listing (created_at_asc | created_at_desc | starts_at_asc | starts_at_desc | stops_at_asc | stops_at_desc)
  [region=fr-par]   Region to target. If none is passed will use default region from the config (fr-par | all)

FLAGS:
  -h, --help[=true|false]                help for list
      --list-sub-commands[=true|false]   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta[=true|false]         Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string             The path to the config file
  -D, --debug[=true|false]        Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers[=true|false]   Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string             Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string            The config profile to use
